        <h3 style="margin-top:20px;">Report Generated Field Mapping / نگاشت اطلاعات تولیدی گزارش به فیلدهای Jira</h3>
        <p class="jim-admin-hint">
            Optionally map generated report metrics to Jira custom fields so you can build filters,
            dashboards, gadgets and exports. Leave a metric blank to disable it. Enter a
            <code>customfield_xxxxx</code> id; the field type must be compatible with the metric type
            (validated on save). Missing fields on this environment are skipped safely at write time.
        </p>
        <table class="aui" style="max-width:820px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Metric</th>
                    <th>فارسی</th>
                    <th>Type</th>
                    <th>توضیح / Description</th>
                    <th>Mapped field (customfield_id) / Disabled = blank</th>
